  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡Bun!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100420075006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hola! Gracias por ayudarme con aquel Bunnelby\nenorme la otra vez.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006F006C006100210020004700720061006300690061007300200070006F00720020006100790075006400610072006D006500200063006F006E00200061007100750065006C002000420075006E006E0065006C00620079000A0065006E006F0072006D00650020006C00610020006F007400720061002000760065007A002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando luchaste contra él, no pude serte de\nayuda y me quedé mirando como un pasmarote...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero aquel día sentí cómo una pequeña llama\nse encendía en mi interior.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Quiero ser fuerte como tú!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100510075006900650072006F0020007300650072002000660075006500720074006500200063006F006D006F0020007400FA002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por eso desde entonces he estado entrenando\nduro.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nComo Entrenador y como viajero, he pasado\npágina y he empezado de cero.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Esta vez no me quedaré mirando!\n¡<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, combate contra mí!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045007300740061002000760065007A0020006E006F0020006D0065002000710075006500640061007200E90020006D006900720061006E0064006F0021000A00A10010000201000000002C00200063006F006D006200610074006500200063006F006E0074007200610020006D00ED002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te mostraré lo enormes que son los lazos que\nme unen a mis queridos Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando estés list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa para el combate, avísame.\n¡Yo ya estoy temblando de la emoción!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Bueno, qué? ¿Ya estás list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa para el combate?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004200750065006E006F002C00200071007500E9003F002000BF00590061002000650073007400E100730020006C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F00610020007000610072006100200065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065003F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "List<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F00610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aún no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100FA006E0020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Perfecto! ¡Vamos allá!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006500720066006500630074006F0021002000A100560061006D006F007300200061006C006C00E1002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Bunnel!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100420075006E006E0065006C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Admira...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410064006D006900720061002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los lazos...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F00730020006C0061007A006F0073002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Enormes...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E006F0072006D00650073002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¡¡Que nos unen!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100A100A10051007500650020006E006F007300200075006E0065006E00210021002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Es la hora de mostrarle un vínculo enorme como\nningún otro! ¡Adelante, Bunnelby!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué me dices? Me ha costado la vida atrapar y\nentrenar a todos estos alfa.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los Pokémon alfa tienen algo que me intriga.\nEs como que rebosan de poder de la naturaleza.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quién sabe? Es posible que en la antigüedad\nsolo hubiera alfas merodeando por ahí.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo me crie aquí, en Ciudad Luminalia, pero\nsiempre quise salir a conocer mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero ahora me he dado cuenta de que hay cosas\npor descubrir y gente por conocer aquí también.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo cual me ha hecho percatarme de algo...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F0020006300750061006C0020006D006500200068006100200068006500630068006F002000700065007200630061007400610072006D006500200064006500200061006C0067006F002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Da igual que estés en un país lejano o en\nla ciudad en la que creciste...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCon la actitud correcta, todo puede ser un viaje.\nLo importante es lo que aprendes por el camino.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 179
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He decidido quedarme un tiempo en Ciudad\nLuminalia y disfrutar del viaje a mi manera.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Bun, bun!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100420075006E002C002000620075006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias por el combate. ¡Algún día te alcanzaré!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061006300690061007300200070006F007200200065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065002E002000A10041006C006700FA006E0020006400ED006100200074006500200061006C00630061006E007A0061007200E9002100100002011401260000",
